{"id":"be37a8a17c1010ee","group":"56","path":"56/56-df-assignment.md","title":"赋值与单点更新","display":"df-assignment — 赋值与单点更新","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)","book_abbrev":"56","label":"56-df-assignment","aliases":["56-df-assignment"],"display":"df-assignment — 赋值与单点更新","depends_on":["[[56-df-structure]]"],"source_status":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization","source_reference":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note","verification_status":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Term Rewriting Systems (Terese, 2003)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"56"},{"key":"label","html":"56-df-assignment"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>56-df-assignment</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-assignment — 赋值与单点更新"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_status","html":"editorial-auxiliary-formalization"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Terese (2003), §§2.5, 7.1; general first-order extension supplied in this note"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"local-definition-reviewed; not-a-book-transcription"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p>设 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)\\)</span>，令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\">\\(\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)\\)</span>，结构及其语言参数见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"3544e74f0e48d8ac\" href=\"?note=3544e74f0e48d8ac\" title=\"56-df-structure\">56-df-structure</a>，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 为该语言所用的变量集。给定 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\">\\(\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\\in\\mathcal V\">\\(x\\in\\mathcal V\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\\in A\">\\(a\\in A\\)</span>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Assignments}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathcal V}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{Assignments}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathcal V}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\coloneqq\\{(y,\\beta(y)):y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\coloneqq\\{(y,\\beta(y)):y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>更新是定义域仍为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal V\">\\(\\mathcal V\\)</span> 的函数；在 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"x\">\\(x\\)</span> 处唯一取值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a\">\\(a\\)</span>。原书 §2.5、Exercise 7.1.12 使用变量赋值；这里的单点更新服务于辅助的一阶量词语义。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[56-df-structure]]","embed":false},{"target":"56-df-structure","status":"resolved","id":"3544e74f0e48d8ac","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"设 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$，令 $\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$，结构及其语言参数见 [[56-df-structure]]，$\\mathcal V$ 为该语言所用的变量集。给定 $\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}$、$x\\in\\mathcal V$、$a\\in A$。","embed":false}],"attachments":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}","display":false},{"tex":"x\\in\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"a\\in A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Assignments}(\\mathfrak A)\\coloneqq A^{\\mathcal V}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\beta[x\\mapsto a]\\coloneqq\\{(y,\\beta(y)):y\\in\\mathcal V\\setminus\\{x\\}\\}\\cup\\{(x,a)\\}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal V","display":false},{"tex":"x","display":false},{"tex":"a","display":false}],"bytes":1125,"backlinks":[{"id":"b729ff69dbfa830d","anchor":"ref-8","locations":["元数据 · depends_on","正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"$\\mathfrak B=(B,K)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Algebra}_{\\Sigma_L}(B,K)$，$\\mathfrak A=(A,I,J)$ 满足 $\\mathrm{Str}_L(A,I,J)$，见 [[56-df-structure]]；$\\gamma\\in B^{\\mathcal V}$、$\\beta\\in A^{\\mathcal V}$。赋值更新 $\\beta[x\\mapsto a]$ 见 [[56-df-assignment]]。"},{"id":"7a89e84aacc9537c","anchor":"ref-317","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[56-df-assignment.md]]"}],"outgoing":["3544e74f0e48d8ac"]}